ome  the joke he says no more they will fear  us again when Thor odinson falls from  the sky then it's revealed that he's  actually talking to somebody he says do  you understand me Hercules do you  understand me my son Hercules is  revealed and he says yes father now for  those of you who watched Ted lasso you  instantly know who this is it is the  actor Brett Goldstein who plays Roy Kent  and Ted lasso and he has packed on some  serious muscle to play the role of  Hercules which of course you have to  it's Hercules now in the comics Thor and  Hercules actually run into each other  quite often and yes in the very  beginning they did Clash a little bit  and fight but for the most part they are  actually allies in fact at one point in  time Hercules is even an Avenger and  they even refer to each other at some  points as closest allies so although  when Hercules and Thor are going to  first meet in the MCU I do see them  clashing I ultimately think that  Hercules is going to be a good guy in  fact in the comics Hercules even  realizes that his father Zeus isn't  exactly the best and Hercules turns on  him and with the help of Thor Zeus is  eventually put on trial so I'm assuming  something very similar is going to  happen here in the MCU Thor and Hercules  will fight but Thor will eventually  explain hey I was trying to save the  universe and your father did nothing to  help he was actually scared and actually  kind of stood in Thor's way telling him  that he couldn't leave a nippoten city  this will probably Open the Eyes of  Hercules realizing that Thor was  actually in the right and his father was  in the wrong and that people shouldn't  fear the gods but the god should  actually be helping the people I'm kind  of expecting this to somewhat be like  Guardians of the Galaxy and Adam Warlock  yes The Sovereign created Adam Warlock  to destroy the Guardians of the Galaxy  but I'm betting by the end of the movie  Guardians 3 Adam Warlock becomes a  guardian of the galaxy and is actually a  hero much like in the comics and those  are the post-credit scenes and the  ending for Thor love and thunder let me  know what you thought of the movie I  want to know your thoughts in the  comments down below don't forget to like  the video and subscribe if you love  Marvel and the MCU for live updates you  can follow me on Instagram and Twitter  and as always thank you all so much for  watching woof woof  foreign

